<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 60,181.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 60,181.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Oct 14 totaled 60,181 bales, up from 53,639 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 6,623 bales issued, no decertification orders, 81 cancellations, and 403 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212 859 1640</p>
